<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Hall prices at range's tip $15.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Hall prices at range's tip $15.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Hall Kinion &amp; Associates Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $15</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $14 - $15</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,515,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	Montgomery Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: The estimated price range for the planned initial public offering in Hall Kinion &amp; Associates Inc was raised to $14 to $15 per common share from $11 to $13 per common share.</p>
